==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Vending|Gastly|S3}} from {{TCG|Vending Machine cards|Expansion Sheet 3}}, which was only released in Japan.
*'''Suffocating Gas''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Sabrina's Gastly|97}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

